    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a personalization function.\n\nInputs:\n- Company: {{ $json.company_name }}\n- About: {{ $json.About }}\n\nTask: Generate both a LinkedIn phrase and an email slug for this company.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"email\": \"string\",\n  \"linkedin\": \"string\"\n}\n\nRULES FOR \"email\":\n- NOT a full email. A personalization slug only.\n- 1–2 sentences max.\n- Sentence-ready: designed to follow \"I wanted to get in touch with {{ $json.company_name }}.\"\n- Use ONLY information explicitly in About. No invented details.\n- Do NOT use the fallback unless About is empty or fewer than 10 words.\n- Fallback only if truly unclear: \"Your work in this space stood out to us.\"\n\nRULES FOR \"linkedin\":\n- 1–4 words, neutral industry/function only (e.g. \"autonomous freight\", \"energy management\").\n- No adjectives, no claims, no buzzwords.\n- HARD LIMIT: 30 characters or fewer.\n- Use ONLY information explicitly in About.\n- Do NOT use the fallback unless About is empty or fewer than 10 words.\n- Fallback only if truly unclear: \"your sector\"\n\nNo markdown. No commentary. JSON only.",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": ""
        }
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -32,
